Package: nkshot
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqt6core6 (>= 6.8), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.8), libqt6qml6, libqt6quick6,
 libqt6quickcontrols2-6, libqt6dbus6, libqt6printsupport6, libqt6multimedia6,
 libkf6coreaddons6, libkf6configcore6, libkf6i18n6, libkf6kio6,
 libkf6windowsystem6, libkf6globalaccel6, libkf6notifications6,
 libkpipewire6, libwayland-client0, libxcb1
Recommends: tesseract-ocr
Maintainer: NextKde <noreply@nextkde.org>
Homepage: https://github.com/NextKde/NkShot
Description: Screenshot and screen recording utility for KDE Plasma
 NkShot captures the desktop, monitors, windows and rectangular regions,
 annotates the result and records PipeWire screencasts.
 .
 Qt 6.8 or newer and KF6 6.13 or newer are required at build time. Recording
 pause additionally needs KPipeWire 6.8 or newer and is left out of the user
 interface when the installed KPipeWire is older.
